---
import { sitePath } from "@utils/paths";
type Props = { sourceSlug?: string };
const { sourceSlug = "unknown" } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="next-action-card" aria-labelledby="next-action-title">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">次にすること</p>
    <h2 id="next-action-title">どれにしますか？</h2>
    <p>途中で焦げ臭さや大きな音が出てきたら、そこで運転を止めて相談してください。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="next-action-links">
    <a href={sitePath("/#chat-title")} data-cvr-action="article_next_action_click" data-action-kind="safe" data-source-slug={sourceSlug}>症状を相談する</a>
    <a href={sitePath("/articles/call-contractor/")} data-cvr-action="article_next_action_click" data-action-kind="contractor" data-source-slug={sourceSlug}>修理を呼ぶ目安</a>
    <a href={sitePath("/by-size/")} data-cvr-action="article_next_action_click" data-action-kind="replacement" data-source-slug={sourceSlug}>買い替えを比べる</a>
  </div>
</section>
